  "description": "SDK for Machinery Energy Management Client & Server development using OPC UA. The OPC UA Machinery Energy Management Companion Specification defines a standardized information model for the acquisition, classification, and monitoring of energy consumption at the level of machinery and machine modules. It enables manufacturers and machine builders to expose energy-related data in a structured, interoperable, and vendor-neutral format—ensuring seamless integration into energy management systems and automation infrastructures.",
